# The-Creators

Minimal travel-tech project for discovering destinations and organizing trip information.

## Overview

The-Creators is a collaborative academic web application focused on international travel. The project is being developed by four students using Python, Flask, HTML, CSS, and JavaScript. The repository is organized to support a clear backend/frontend split, database scripts, and contributor-friendly workflows.

## Objectives

- Help users discover destinations in other countries.
- Organize travel information in a simple, useful interface.
- Build a small full-stack web application using Flask and frontend Fetch requests.
- Maintain a clean repository structure suitable for academic collaboration.

## Planned features

The feature set is still being confirmed by the team. The repository currently reflects the project foundation rather than a complete product implementation.

Possible planned areas include:

- Destination discovery and browsing.
- Travel destination details.
- Trip planning and organization tools.
- Information cards and user interaction flows.

## Technology stack

- Python
- Flask
- Object-oriented programming (OOP)
- SQL / relational database
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- Fetch API

